{"version": 1, "sourceSha256": "ea6ef54f9638a649e08f02cedf91a94d927ddf07c1807deb1cc0d9589aea58bb", "documents": [{"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}, {"id": "offline-ea6ef54f9638a649e08f", "filename": "Track 20.mp3", "sha256": "ea6ef54f9638a649e08f02cedf91a94d927ddf07c1807deb1cc0d9589aea58bb", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-5/ea6ef54f9638a649e08f02cedf91a94d927ddf07c1807deb1cc0d9589aea58bb.mp3", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/ea6ef54f9638a649e08f02cedf91a94d927ddf07c1807deb1cc0d9589aea58bb.json", "format": "mp3", "role": "recording"}], "units": [{"id": "jahshan-1AlWtGN1XgeAz0afHysOAQgRPMEi8IWyc-C-0", "label": "Jahshan set 1 · Part C", "part": "C", "sourceSha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "pages": [21, 22], "questions": [{"number": 7, "prompt": "Dr Johnson explains that delays are increased when patients believe\n(A) their appointment will not begin on time.\n(B) staff are not concerned about late-arrivals.\n(C) being late for appointments will not impact others.", "sourcePage": 21, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 26, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 8, "prompt": "Dr Johnson uses an example of poor efficiency to illustrate the point that\n(A) healthcare professionals should assist staff during busy times.\n(B) practices should avoid limiting appointment booking options.\n(C) staff should be trained to handle demanding situations.", "sourcePage": 21, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 26, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 9, "prompt": "Dr Johnson explains that, in order to improve efficiency, healthcare\npractices must\n(A) sanction patients arriving later than 10 minutes.\n(B) avoid booking appointments in the morning.\n(C) show patients that they can run on time.", "sourcePage": 21, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 26, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 10, "prompt": "Dr Johnson says healthcare professionals often forget that patients who\nbook appointments must first\n(A) feel that they need a consultation.\n(B) find a time and date that works for them.\n(C) consider what might be causing their issue.", "sourcePage": 22, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 26, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 11, "prompt": "What happened when Dr Johnson began giving weekly presentations to\npatients?\n(A) Dr Johnson was able to work fewer hours.\n(B) The general health of patients was increased.\n(C) The number of appointments at the practice decreased.", "sourcePage": 22, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 26, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 12, "prompt": "How does Dr Johnson feel about the use of technology when booking\nappointments?\n(A) Practices should begin to encourage all patients to make\nbookings online.\n(B) It can increase efficiency if other booking methods are\ncontinued.\n(C) Elderly people are most likely to struggle to use it.", "sourcePage": 22, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 26, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}], "skills": ["listening"], "recordings": ["ea6ef54f9638a649e08f02cedf91a94d927ddf07c1807deb1cc0d9589aea58bb"], "answerSources": [], "matchEvidence": "Exact original recording SHA-256 in the verified Jahshan collection"}]}
